<title>USA: USDA delays release of cotton ginnings report.</title>
<headline>USDA delays release of cotton ginnings report.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-10-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>The U.S. Agriculture Department said its Cotton Ginnings report was delayed until Friday at 0900 EDT/1300 GMT.</p>
<p>The report was scheduled for release Thursday at 1500 EDT.</p>
<p>-- Washington Commodities Desk (202) 898-8394</p>
</text>
